# The Ornithopter attacks and is tapped before being targeted; Winter Blast still deals 2 damage to it (CR 701.26a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Winter Blast
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Winter Blast.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Winter Blast
